unit weights. The last column is $(a_1,a_2,a_3,a_4;t)$; set $a_n=0$
for $n>4$, and let k be the number of tables in the row.

| Bundle | Tables | Coefficients |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Z | empty:0 | $(-1,-1,0,0;0)$ |
| H | $12:004$ | $(-2,-2,1,2;-1)$ |
| S1 | $13:034$ | $(-2,-1,2,2;-1)$ |
| S2 | $23:034$ | $(-1,-2,2,2;-1)$ |
